intelligentroutingd(8)      System Manager's Manual     intelligentroutingd(8)

NAME
     intelligentroutingd – A daemon that provides recommendations based on
     history patterns.

DESCRIPTION
     intelligentroutingd is a per-user daemon that provides recommendations
     based on history patterns.

     There are no configurations to intelligentroutingd, and users should not
     run intelligentroutingd manually.

